IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cpf-self-employed`

-- Central Provident Fund Act 1953, s 9A and the Self-Employed Persons Regulations, from the self-employed person's seat -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case. The subsidiary legislation used is named in the module's header.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_central-provident-fund-act-1953_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a rider born 30 August 2006 with $31,000 of trade income in 2027` MEANS `My relevant year` WITH
